{"membership_id": "membership:2g:2c11ee746ea1a664fa1eceb7", "entity_id": "e:d8261bffa2d52192c8fcb577350369248387df8a0dd0a7031b1cd0ff307b790f", "concept_id": "concept:2f2:annual_papal_medals", "document_id": "W2394633461", "decision_id": "decision:2g:3df862033c8c86188d4a33b0", "resolver_version": "dynamic-concepts-v1", "factual": false, "identity": false, "fact_inheritance_allowed": false, "evidence": {"lexical_rule": "explicit_named_class", "entity_forms": ["generic annual medal"], "concept_forms": ["annual medal", "annual papal medal"], "entity_types": ["OBJECT"], "reference_types": ["OBJECT"], "entity_sense_witnesses": {"historical": ["medals", "papal", "popes"]}, "reference_sense_witnesses": {"historical": ["medals", "papal", "pope"]}, "shared_senses": ["historical"], "source_contexts": [{"document_id": "W2394633461", "revision_id": "sha256:d5203d9ab3268c0e6f2ba115965411aaed58b46a836a80da8a75c460e5941ef9", "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W2394633461", "source_canonical_id": "e:d8261bffa2d52192c8fcb577350369248387df8a0dd0a7031b1cd0ff307b790f", "source_entity_id": "e:d8261bffa2d52192c8fcb577350369248387df8a0dd0a7031b1cd0ff307b790f", "source_mention_ids": ["m:0515fc74e901737e070c066d4a0b113b468d72fbacb5087cdd0fb331d607bae5"], "start": 476, "end": 737, "text": "olitics. In the ninety-six years under consideration, ten popes issued ninety-four annual medals (sede vacante produced generic annual medals in 1667 and 1691). Annual medals are a unique iteration of papal commemorative medals and they celebrate an important p", "mention_start": 596, "mention_end": 617, "mention_text": "generic annual medals"}], "reference_contexts": [{"document_id": "W2394633461", "revision_id": "sha256:d5203d9ab3268c0e6f2ba115965411aaed58b46a836a80da8a75c460e5941ef9", "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W2394633461", "source_canonical_id": "e:023d0e8812d04e70f80cde95af8d18faa8b8f7ca4ba85f9e9dd1cfc33745fd35", "source_entity_id": "e:023d0e8812d04e70f80cde95af8d18faa8b8f7ca4ba85f9e9dd1cfc33745fd35", "source_mention_ids": ["m:b995b8f2ff9c016dc9207b24f52cd05c98428bd3685b759147a1ec38ba67e62b"], "start": 677, "end": 930, "text": "papal commemorative medals and they celebrate an important papal achievement from the preceding year. The production of annual medals was an exercise in identity creation, undertaken to advance the image of the pope as an aristocratic prince in three sp", "mention_start": 797, "mention_end": 810, "mention_text": "annual medals"}], "reference_entity_id": "e:023d0e8812d04e70f80cde95af8d18faa8b8f7ca4ba85f9e9dd1cfc33745fd35", "reference_document_id": "W2394633461"}}
